Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.97,0:00:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)我们的心 已经决定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赌上大家的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用决斗来一决胜负吧！ Dr.菲卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.67,0:00:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.菲卡)好吧我就 奉陪到底。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.69,0:00:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.55,0:00:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.99,0:00:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我们见识一下 最棒的燃烧决斗吧。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些家伙 对我能做些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这里把你们打得粉碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被打得粉碎的 是你才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)和你就在这里 做个了断！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)你那 无聊的野心就由我来粉碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(3人)Dr.菲卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。 你这是要反抗我咯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菲卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 你们三个一起放马过来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能输！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.81,0:01:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗模式 光子变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.63,0:01:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.52,0:02:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（三人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.57,0:02:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你们了 快斗 游马 鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.15,0:02:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来就交给你们了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的生命值是三人共通的 4000。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的 生命值就取你们三人的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:03:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}12000吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻是我。 抽卡！ 哼。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你们见识一下。 我灵魂的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 垃圾食人魔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌 送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将「垃圾·领主」加入手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后「垃圾·领主」可以通过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.33,0:04:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付1000生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌进行特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.73,0:04:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只「垃圾·领主」特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.89,0:04:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(3人)什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！3只「垃圾·领主」！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气3只怪兽!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.50,0:04:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在抖什么呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才…才不是那样！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级5的「垃圾·领主」3只
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.51,0:04:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.47,0:05:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是立于 No.顶点的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.35,0:05:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身披超然之铠震撼世界吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.52,0:05:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.66,0:05:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.的力量被吸进去了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.29,0:05:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.53！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伪骸神 心脏地球！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力100的怪兽。这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会受到你们的魔法 陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果的影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖两张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 先手是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！游马。那家伙的 No. 有什么蹊跷。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.29,0:06:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力100的怪兽什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.39,0:06:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看我把它踢飞！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦……最初的对手是你吗。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么就先从你开始抹消掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪有那么容易！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的我有鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.09,0:06:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为有星光才有了结成的同伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光，我一定会救出你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.82,0:06:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.35,0:06:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤哥布林德·巴格！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.26,0:06:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后哥布林德·巴格召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.51,0:06:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌将1只等级4以下的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.08,0:06:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.51,0:06:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着我将等级4的哥布林德·巴格和
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:06:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:07:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.27,0:07:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤额外怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.53,0:07:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！No.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我与星光体的羁绊之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了吗 希望皇 霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我 在这个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 战斗法则！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.81,0:07:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.79,0:07:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场上有怪兽存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的攻击表示怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.76,0:07:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须进行战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.25,0:07:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 怎么回事怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个 No.的攻击力仅仅只有100。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.61,0:07:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可为什么还要发动强制战斗的卡发动？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.85,0:07:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是想让我们去攻击他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。所以不能贸然……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光纠结也没用！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，霍普！攻击心之地球！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不顾后果这一点倒是和一马一样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动心之地球的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡受到攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从墓地装备1张怪兽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加贝奇·欧加装备到心之地球上。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.37,0:08:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，心之地球的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会上升与战斗对象怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原本攻击力相同的数值！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.44,0:08:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只 No.怪就算攻击力低{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要被攻击就必定会超过对方的攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，心脏地球的攻击力就是2600。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！假面爆裂！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我通过使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让这次攻击无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好，游马！上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！速攻魔法，翻倍机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在怪兽的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被无效的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让攻击力变成2倍还能再攻击一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～，霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对心脏地球再攻击一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.49,0:09:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑，双重斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.79,0:09:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了吗！这就是我的希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那种希望什么的在我的面前如同垃圾一般。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.77,0:09:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会把你粉碎得连渣都不剩！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之地球的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.59,0:09:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之地球 将装备卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.93,0:09:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能无效那次破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且！ 当心之地球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.81,0:10:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将装备卡送入墓地时！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将变化数值的一半伤害给予对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 使用超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动心之地球的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当心之地球给予对手伤害时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就按照那个数值回复生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 No.们……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.86,0:10:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有回复生命值的能力吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之地球… 攻击力提升与破坏无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上 追加攻击带 生命回复…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这简直就是… 最强的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:11:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是老样子打得真烂啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.85,0:11:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.78,0:11:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 干得不错。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来 交给我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.23,0:11:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用我这副獠牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.27,0:11:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你撕成碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.18,0:11:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.73,0:11:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨… 鲨鱼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《啧… 不妙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.84,0:11:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 那时候的…》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.19,0:11:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？害怕了吗，凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了……！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤锤头鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.45,0:11:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴的卡也能化为力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把希望皇霍普的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:11:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元全部送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.25,0:11:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的希望皇霍普的超量单元……！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.33,0:12:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别罗嗦个没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.34,0:12:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为把超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.53,0:12:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.93,0:12:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤英豪冠军 断钢剑王！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用这家伙进行超量召唤的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.66,0:12:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地的超量单元的数量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以减少相应的素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的英豪激励者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和锤头鲨这2只怪兽进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.24,0:12:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！ 现身吧 No.32！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.29,0:12:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙 鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.89,0:12:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的决斗给了我提示。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动装备魔法 盾鳍！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.49,0:13:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把它装备给 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你的霍普我借用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～ 霍普！ 攻击心脏地球！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那种攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对这张天才卡是打不中的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动心脏地球的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡受到攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地选1张怪兽卡可以装备。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.49,0:13:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过这个效果装备了装备卡的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心脏地球的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升对方怪兽原本攻击力的数值！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也变成垃圾消失吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}假面燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.70,0:13:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一刻… 我等好久了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我！发动盾·鳍的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在这个回合结束前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将装备怪兽的原本攻击力变成零{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效战斗造成的破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.85,0:14:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙注意到了心脏地球的弱点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实会受到伤害，但才只有100而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！ 是因为霍普的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成了零{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.14,0:14:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以Heart Earth的攻击力才没能提升吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 游马 多亏了你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才能注意到那家伙的弱点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Heart Earth提升攻击力的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合只能使用一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.53,0:14:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 如果攻击力没有变化
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.47,0:14:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成伤害的效果也无法使用！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咆哮吧！ 鲨鱼·德雷克！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击Heart Earth！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊噬咬！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.61,0:14:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}饥饿的鲨鱼是嗅到了微弱的血腥味吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.94,0:14:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那种程度的伤对我可不管用！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之地球的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将装备中的卡片送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能让这张卡的破坏无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 怎么办啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又给治好了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.34,0:15:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连你的希望也一并废弃掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 心之地球的 怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将受到伤害的 那一半数值
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.21,0:15:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？ 不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.74,0:15:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！ 这就是天才的裁决！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.75,0:15:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.99,0:15:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的 生命回复是攻击力也能改变吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:16:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.27,0:16:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的意志，由我来继承。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次轮到我了！Dr.费卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马，愚蠢的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到你竟敢反抗我。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你们一起送进地狱！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少废话！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.16,0:16:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要把你打垮……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特，我一定要亲手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你救出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后召唤光子粉碎者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，光子粉碎者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再特殊召唤光子斩击者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡不能通常召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上有怪兽存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:17:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌以表侧守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 光子斩击者与
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子杀戮者 解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.14,0:17:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在黑暗中闪耀的银河啊化作希望之光{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄宿于我仆身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光之化身 在此降临！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ 银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 游马他们的羁绊合为一体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望鲨·德雷克 银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家的王牌怪兽都齐聚一堂了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢的儿子啊尽管放马过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别管他！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.25,0:17:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没…没什么啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:18:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来作为数字猎人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.76,0:18:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的身体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.11,0:18:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经到极限了啊，海斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！海斗可是为了你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.49,0:18:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才变成这样的身体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此，你还算是海斗的爸爸吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡博士。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你的谎言，我和银河
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直被玷污着。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.81,0:18:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是让你偿还的时候了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海斗，你做得到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《确实，只要使用护盾·鳍的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.11,0:18:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能给那家伙造成伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，问题在于
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用心之地球的超载单元的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算给那家伙造成伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那部分也会反弹到我们这边。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.32,0:18:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎么做我们都没有胜算。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是！》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你的怪兽我借来用用！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.45,0:18:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用希望皇霍普攻击心脏地球！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.09,0:18:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.90,0:18:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡受到攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从自己的墓地里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.39,0:19:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备1张怪兽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.60,0:19:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要装备的是 这张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加贝奇·欧加！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 心脏地球的攻击力就是2600。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧 假面爆裂！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 就在这个瞬间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备在霍普身上的盾鳍的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将装备怪兽的攻击力变为零{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.31,0:19:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使其不会被战斗破坏使其无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我用鲨鱼·龙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击心脏地球！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.69,0:19:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又来同样的招数！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.66,0:19:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)上吧 鲨鱼·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.26,0:19:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深咬鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心脏地球的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.49,0:19:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将装备卡送去墓地使破坏无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 心脏地球的更进一步的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.78,0:19:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将受到伤害的一半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 1350的伤害给予对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就结束了！ 海马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的生命值 还剩1200！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是挨下这招的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.06,0:20:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 跪下吧 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该跪下的人 是你才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 光子圣域！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.72,0:20:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在自己场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有光子怪兽存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.77,0:20:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对玩家造成的效果伤害无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.90,0:20:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！ 快斗还有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼剩下的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}面对剩余生命值2450的对手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3000的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.59,0:20:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼攻击通过的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.03,0:20:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.费卡 我一直
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.05,0:20:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都在遵从你的命令！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.62,0:20:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为 No.猎人 不断狩猎着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:20:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无辜人们的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信着这样就能救出哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.25,0:21:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那一切都是假的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.42,0:21:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会原谅你！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对遥人，还有众多的灵魂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.36,0:21:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好忏悔的准备了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.92,0:21:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.45,0:21:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，赢了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他们赢了呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.24,0:21:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}噢噢！终于靠我们的手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.59,0:21:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒了Dr.费卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}活该！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.57,0:21:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难、难道说!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.89,0:22:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说，这是新的 No.卡!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.49,0:23:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.13,0:23:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.14,0:23:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.02,0:23:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.79,0:23:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.17,0:23:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.55,0:23:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.01,0:24:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.09,0:24:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.74,0:24:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普 鲨鱼龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.42,0:24:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.22,0:24:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这3体竟然会共同战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.56,0:24:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！霍普·龙·眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.55,0:24:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到竟然会合体……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.34,0:24:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不会死呢。

